# --- axi: build speed ---
# .git was 412MB of the 856MB build context, and it changes on every commit,
# so `COPY . .` was invalidated every time and the 19-minute vite build re-ran
# even when no source had changed. svelte.config.js reads `git rev-parse HEAD`
# for the version name used to trigger client reloads; APP_BUILD_HASH now
# carries that instead, so nothing is lost by leaving git out.
.git
.gitignore

# The host's own build output. The image takes /app/build from the build STAGE,
# never from the context, so this was pure weight — 260MB that changed every
# time anyone ran npm run build locally.
/build
